{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109692","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109692/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109692/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109692/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109692","id":3328269897,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6j_D78","number":109692,"title":"Add static method `from_scalar` to vector 2/3 types.","user":{"login":"WhalesState","id":53877170,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODc3MTcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53877170?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState","html_url":"https://github.com/WhalesState","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":9,"created_at":"2025-08-17T12:02:09Z","updated_at":"2026-02-07T12:37:40Z","closed_at":"2025-08-19T12:19:26Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":true,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109692","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109692","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109692.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109692.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Refactors vector initializations by replacing repeated scalar arguments and redundant operations with `from_scalar`, making the code shorter, easier to read, and slightly more efficient.\r\n\r\nA shorter, more concise name would be appreciated, such as `fill`, `splat`, or `uniform`.\r\n\r\nUse cases:\r\n\r\n- **Temporary variable elimination:**\r\n  ```c++\r\n  const real_t radius2 = Math::sqrt(double(new_simplex->circum_r2)) + 0.0001;\r\n  Vector3 extents = Vector3(radius2, radius2, radius2);\r\n  ```\r\n  Changed to:\r\n  ```c++\r\n  Vector3 extents = Vector3::from_scalar(Math::sqrt(double(new_simplex->circum_r2)) + 0.0001);\r\n  ```\r\n- **Line shortening:**\r\n   ```c++\r\n   Size2i(options6.ShadingRateImageTileSize, options6.ShadingRateImageTileSize)\r\n   ```\r\n   Changed to:\r\n   ```c++\r\n   Size2i::from_scalar(options6.ShadingRateImageTileSize)\r\n   ```\r\n- **Redundant operation elimination:**\r\n   ```c++\r\n   Vector2i(border / 2, border / 2)\r\n   Size2(400, 400) * EDSCALE\r\n   ```\r\n   Changed to:\r\n   ```c++\r\n   Vector2i::from_scalar(border / 2)\r\n   Size2::from_scalar(400 * EDSCALE)\r\n   ```\r\n- **Dummy vector scaling elimination:**\r\n  ```c++\r\n  Vector3(1, 1, 1) * cascade.cell_size * probe_cells;\r\n  ```\r\n  Changed to:\r\n  ```c++\r\n  Vector3::from_scalar(cascade.cell_size * probe_cells);\r\n  ```\r\n  \r\n* Here's another implementation using constructors which is much better: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109687","closed_by":{"login":"WhalesState","id":53877170,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODc3MTcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53877170?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState","html_url":"https://github.com/WhalesState","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109692/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":4},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109692/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}